    [Doc][Misc] Fix internal section links and clarify product names in documentation (#19972)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    This PR updates several documentation files to improve navigation and
    clarity. It replaces plain text section and chapter references with
    functional markdown anchor links and expands product abbreviations
    (e.g., "A2, A3, and 950DT") to their full names (e.g., "Atlas A2 Series
    Products (A2), Atlas A3 Series Products (A3), and Ascend 950DT Products
    (950DT Products)"). No review comments were provided, so there is no
    feedback to address.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No, these are documentation-only updates.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    No functional testing is required as these are documentation-only
    changes.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/544f182d9f0c9bfe8bd7645525951d5e3692a542
    
    Signed-off-by: sunshine202600 <sunshine202600@163.com>

